#: alsa/alsabackend.cpp:78
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Fatal error from the ALSA sequencer backend. This usually happens when the "
"kernel does not have ALSA support, the device node (/dev/snd/seq) does not "
"exist, or the kernel module (snd_seq) is not loaded. Please check your ALSA/"
"MIDI configuration. Returned error was: %1"
msgstr ""
"Kobna greška pozadine sekvencera Alse. Ovo se obično događa kada jezgro nema "
"podršku za Alsu, čvorište uređaja (<filename>/dev/snd/seq</filename>) ne "
"postoji ili modul jezgra (<filename>snd_seq</filename>) nije učitan. "
"Provjerite postavu Alse/MIDI‑ja. Vraćena greška je: %1"

